     "type": "text",
     "text": "{\"count\":2,\"rationale\":\"Block iotDevice:exploitPublicApp and vaultRead:collection. Blocking iotDevice stops memoryDump, which takes out printServer and mailArchive. It also stops rdpLogin, so monitoringHost and dbReplica fall. vpnSession falls too, which removes secretsManager, and serviceAccount loses printServer. With both serviceAccount and secretsManager gone, shareMount is cut. vaultRead could still be reached through appServer (via configSecret or dbLogin), so it is blocked directly. One block is not enough. The path entry→containerHost→configSecret→appServer→vaultRead and the path entry→iotDevice→memoryDump→printServer→mailArchive share no blockable step, so no single step cuts both.\"}"
    }
   ],
